[com_3]
type=text
x=7
y=1
width=464
height=246
layer=com_10
textfont=p12_full
text=The aim of this game is to collect as many resource points as possible in five minutes. <br>You can gather resources from mining resources to the north,  woodcutting resources to the east or farming resources to the west. Different coloured resources are worth different numbers of resource points. They also require different skill levels.<br><br>Blue - Level 1<br>Gold - Level 20<br>Black - Level 40<br>Green - Level 60<br>Red - Level 80<br><br>Higher level resources are worth more points, but they take longer to respawn or regrow. Collect a variety of different resource types for a bonus to your score and experience reward.<br><br>Once you have harvested a resource, you must take it to the deposit point at the centre of the island. Only deposited resources count towards your final score.
textalignv=centre
textshadow=yes
colour=0xebe0bc

